Embedded system software development with Borland C++ has never been
better.  Paradigm Systems, the leading vendor of embedded system
software development tools for the Intel 80C186 and NEC V-Series
microprocessors, fully supports Borland C++ in embedded system
applications.

The file PARADIGM.EXE is a full-featured demo of how Paradigm and
Borland work together to produce embedded system applications. 
Covering both the development and debugging phases, the demo will
give you an inside look at how Borland C++, Paradigm LOCATE, and
Paradigm DEBUG lead the way in 16-bit embedded system development
tools.
